\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The rule with what is already in the workshop is short: 
\series bold
ASA for everything printed and loaded, PETG for buttons and hinges, PLA for nothing mechanical.
\series default
 The purchase that changes most is carbon-filled polyamide (PA-CF): short levers and brackets 2.5 times stiffer and little creep.
\end_layout

